PIO# ============================================================================
# RCLKGNSS.PCF
# ============================================================================
#
# Description:  - Computes the receiver and satellite clock corrections
#                 based on the observation data from a global GNSS network.
#               - The orbits, ERPs, and (as far as available) station
#                 coordinates are taken from the IGSRAPID campaign.
#               - The results are provided in clock RINEX format.
#                 In addition, the SP3 file in the IGSRAPID campaign is
#                 completed by the satellite clock corrections.
#
#               RCLKGNSS BPE processing summary file name: CLKyyssss.PRC
#
# Comments   :  - BPEs may run in parallel for several sessions
#                 (WAIT_BPE makes sure that the BPEs keep the order of
#                 the sessions where it is necessary)
#
# Flag files :  REPROCESSING.FLG
#               - runs a single day independent from all other days
#               - the input data are taken from $CAMP_SAVREP
#               - the results are put there too, and labelled with the
#                    second line of the REPROCESSING.FLG file
#               GLO_ONE_CLUST.FLG
#               - if this file exists, all GLONASS stations are processed
#                    together in one cluster (the other clusters are
#                    analyzed in the GPS-only mode).
#
# Author     :  R. Dach
# Created    :  13-May-2009
#
# Changes    :  09-Oct-2012/ss: Switch from IGS08 to IGb08
#               19-Jul-2013/rd,hb: V_OBSSEL added
#               01-Nov-2013/rd,eo: SAT_1452 -> SAT_NONE for V_SATINF
#               06-Jun-2014 SS: Use of middle day (if available)?
#               18-Sep-2014 LP: Change V_GNSS
#               06-Jul-2015 SS: Save .BIA results (CBS, CBF, TP_)
#               03-Aug-2015 SS: RCLKGNSS activated as operational CLKRAPID
#               16-Sep-2015 SS: Execute INIT_HOI/INIT_VMF after each RCLKWAIT
#               20-Oct-2015 LP: Take extra manual SATMRK from CLKRAPID
#               31-May-2016 SS/AV: Updated due to OSB implementation
#               13-Sep-2016 SS: Create CBR bias results
#               15-Sep-2016 SS: Added RAP_BIA for clock/iono bias combination
#               21-Sep-2016 AV: V_PSDINF introduced
#               28-Sep-2016 SS: Added second call of RAP_BIA
#               10-Oct-2016 RD/AV: Remove Section with compatible attitude modelling
#               30-Jan-2017 RD: Switch from IGB08 to IGS14
#               04-Mar-2017 AV: FILEST amd SATMON added
#               04-Dec-2017 AV: V_MACMOD and V_BOXWNG introduced
#               30-May-2018 SS: Added V_IAR
#               04-Jun-2018 SS: Added INIT_IAR and DO_PPPAR
#               21-Jun-2018 SS: Added ZERO_AR verification sequence
#               22-Jun-2018 SS: Simplified params $tmpnnn to $nnn
#               05-Jul-2018 SS: Moved INIT_IAR step
#               09-Jul-2018 SS: Changed DO_PPPAR PARAM4 from 1 to 0
#               10-Jul-2018 SS: Changed DO_PPPAR PARAM4 from 0 to 1
#                               (temporary $mscrc/IAR.FLG with 0)
#               16-Jan-2019 SS: Added WAIT
#               21-Aug-2019 RD: Add V_BLQINF, V_SUBMOD, V_NUTMOD
#               14-Nov-2019 AV: Add V_SAVDSK
#               03-Feb-2020 RD: Switch from FES2004 to FES2014b
#               18-May-2020 SS: Switched to IGb14
#               02-Oct-2020 SS: Added CCRNXC verification step (SAT_CHK)
#               21-Oct-2020 AV: Add V_ARMODE
#               24-Nov-2020 RD: Run CDDIS-HTTPS submission on sedna
#               02-Dec-2020 AV: Run CDDIS-HTTPS on local (IGSR_FTP)
#               07-Dec-2020 RD: Add PCF variable V_TRPMOD
#               18-Mar-2021 AV: Replace IGSR_FTP with IGSR_DIS
#               30-Jun-2021 SS: Added extra SATMRK to cope with new G11
#               11-Jul-2021 LP: Switch TRPMOD GMF->GPT3
#               02-Sep-2021 RD: Transform into the new PCF format
#               02-Sep-2021 RD/ST: Reorder BPE server variables for reporting
#               27-Sep-2021 RD/AV: V_SP3INT added (sampling in STDPRE)
#               28-Sep-2021 RD: Switch V_SP3INT from 900 to 300 (for Galileo)
#               28-Nov-2021 LP: Remove V_MACMOD
#               28-Mar-2022 ST: Rename V_CAMP to V_REQ_CAMP.
#               29-Mar-2022 AV: Modfied OBSSEL, SATINF, PCVINF, BIAINF, BOXWING
#               27-Oct-2022 SS: Introduced V_PCC4MWGF
#               03-Nov-2022 AV: Add RINEX3 clock
#               28-Nov-2022 AV: Switch from IGb14 to IGS20
#                               Change IGSR_DIS to IGSR_DI2
#               06-Dec-2022 LP: Switch from BOXWING.MAC to BOXWING_I20.MAC
#               20-Mar-2023 ST: Put CPU=LOCAL for CODSPPAP, CODSPPCP, FILESTAP,
#                               GLOESTAP, MAUPRPAP, MRKOBSAP, RNXSMTAP, TIMESTAP.
#                               Put parallel jobs with CPU=SHORT to CPU=QUICK.
#               08-May-2023 LP: Add V_GRAVMOD; replace EGM2008_SMALL -> COSTG_FSM_2212
#               20-Sep-2023 SS: Updated V_GRAVMOD to COSTG_FSM_2303
#               11-Dec-2023 RD: Add script DELALL to clean old files from the campaign
#               09-Jan-2024 LP: Updated V_GRAVMOD to COSTG_FSM_2309
#               03-Sep-2024 LP: Updated V_GRAVMOD to COSTG_FSM_2312
#               25-Sep-2024 RD: Add OBSXTR for edit and ambres
#               22-Oct-2024 MK: Updated V_GRAVMOD to COSTG_FSM_2406
#               02-Feb-2025 EB: Change from IGS20 to IGB20
#               28-Aug-2025 ML/CK: Updated V_GRAVMOD to COSTG_FSM_2412
#               28-Aug-2025 SS: PID 191 should also wait for PID 152 (CBF)
#               19-Sep-2025 EB: Updated V_GRAVMOD to COSTG_FSM_2503
#               26-Nov-2025 SS: Added V_DOI
#               12-Jan-2026 EB/SS: Changed from IGB20 to IGC20 and from I20_2388 to I20_2401=I20
#               17-Jan-2026 SS: Added BPE_INI with PARAM1=-nopcv
#               28-Jan-2026 SS: Added V_INI=Y
#               23-Feb-2026 EB: Updated V_GRAVMOD to COSTG_FSM_2509
#               19-May-2026 RD: Update V_DOIs
#               06-Jul-2026 SS: Updated V_GRAVMOD to COSTG_FSM_2603
#               25-Aug-2026 RD: Correct syntax for CARDS ("/"->" " between elements)
#
# ============================================================================

PID  SCRIPT    OPT_DIR   PARAMETERS
000  BPE_INI   NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; PARAM1=-nopcv; SCR_PATH=${AIUB}/BPE_SCR
001  WAIT_BPE  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=000; PARAM1=051
002  WAIT      NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=001
#
# Copy required files and create a priori CRD file
# ------------------------------------------------
011  RCLK_COP  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=002; PARAM1=DENSIFY
012  COOVEL    RCLK_GEN  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=011
#
# Preparing the RINEX files
# -------------------------
020  RNXSMTAP  RCLK_RNX  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=011
021  RNXSMT_P  RCLK_RNX  CPU=QUICK; WAIT=020; PARALLEL=020
040  RXOBV3GP  RCLK_RNX  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=021
041  RXOBV3_P  RCLK_RNX  CPU=QUICK; WAIT=040; PARALLEL=040
042  SATMRK    RCLK_9    CPU=SHORT; WAIT=041
043  MKCLUS    RCLK_RNX  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=042
#
# Start preprocessing
# -------------------
050  WAIT_BPE  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=012 043; PARAM1=121
051  RCLKWAIT  RCLK_GEN  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=050; PARAM1=RF_ORBIT; PARAM2=RF_ORBIT
052  NAV2CLK   RCLK_GEN  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=051
053  INIT_HOI  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=052
054  INIT_VMF  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=053
055  LSC_INI   NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=054
060  CODSPPAP  RCLK_GEN  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=055
061  CODSPP_P  RCLK_GEN  CPU=QUICK; WAIT=060; PARALLEL=060
062  CODXTR    RCLK_GEN  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=061; NEXTJOB=060
063  CCRNXC    RCLK_GEN  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=062
064  SATUNMRK  RCLK_NEW  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=062
#
# Compute weights for the code
# ----------------------------
080  TIMESTAP  RCLK_WGT  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=062 064; PARAM2=V_I
081  TIMEST_C  RCLK_WGT  CPU=QUICK; WAIT=080; PARALLEL=080
082  GPSXTR    RCLK_WGT  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=081
083  RCLK_CHK  RCLK_WGT  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=082; NEXTJOB=084 080
084  RESRMS    RCLK_WGT  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=083
#
091  FILESTAP  RCLK_MON  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=084
092  FILEST_P  RCLK_MON  CPU=FOX; WAIT=091; PARALLEL=091
093  SATMONAP  RCLK_MON  CPU=MEGA; WAIT=092; PARAM3=RCLK; PARAM4=30
094  SATMON_P  RCLK_MON  CPU=FOX; WAIT=093; PARALLEL=093
#
# Preprocessing: generate satellite clocks
# ----------------------------------------
099  WAIT_BPE  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=063 084 094; PARAM1=300
#
# Delete old files from the campaign
# Run in parallel to the code bias computation
# ----------------------------------
100  DELALL    NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=099; SCR_PATH=${AIUB}/BPE_SCR
# ----------------------------------
#
# Clean code residuals
# --------------------
121  TIMESTAP  RCLK_COD  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=099; PARAM2=V_B
122  TIMEST_A  RCLK_COD  CPU=BIG; WAIT=121; PARALLEL=121
123  GPSXTR    RCLK_COD  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=122
124  RCLK_CHK  RCLK_COD  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=123; NEXTJOB=125 121
125  RESRMS    RCLK_COD  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=124
126  ADDNEQ2   RCLK_SB1  CPU=BIG; WAIT=122
131  MRKOBSAP  RCLK_COD  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=125
132  MRKOBS_P  RCLK_COD  CPU=QUICK; WAIT=131; PARALLEL=131
#
# Unifyed inter-system/inter-frequency code biases
# ------------------------------------------------
141  TIMESTAP  RCLK_SB2  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=132; PARAM2=V_C
142  TIMEST_C  RCLK_SB2  CPU=BIG; WAIT=141; PARALLEL=141
143  ADDNEQ2   RCLK_SB2  CPU=BIG; WAIT=142
#
# OSB-Extraction
# --------------
151  IFBNEQ    RCLK_SBS  CPU=BIG; WAIT=143; NEXTJOB=141
152  ADDNEQ2   RCLK_SBF  CPU=BIG; WAIT=151
153  ADDNEQ2   RCLK_SBR  CPU=BIG; WAIT=151
154  ADDNEQ2   RCLK_SBG  CPU=BIG; WAIT=151
191  RAP_BIA   RCLK_BIA  CPU=BIG; WAIT=151 152 153 154
#
# Preprocessing: phase
# --------------------
270  RCLKWAIT  RCLK_GEN  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=100 142; PARAM1=RA_ORBIT; PARAM2=RH_ORBIT
271  INIT_HOI  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=270
272  INIT_VMF  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=271
280  MKCLUS    RCLK_GEN  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=272; PARAM1=V_K
281  LSC_INI   NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=151 280
282  CLKESTCB  RCLK_GEN  CPU=BIG; WAIT=281; PARAM1=V_E
283  LSC_CHK   RCLK_CHK  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=282; NEXTJOB=282
290  MAUPRPAP  RCLK_GEN  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=283
291  MAUPRP_P  RCLK_GEN  CPU=QUICK; WAIT=290; PARALLEL=290
292  MPRXTR    RCLK_GEN  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=291
#
# Preprocessing: residual check
# -----------------------------
299  WAIT_BPE  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=123 152 292; PARAM1=400
300  RCLKWAIT  RCLK_GEN  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=299; PARAM1=RA_ORBIT; PARAM2=RH_ORBIT
301  INIT_HOI  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=300
302  INIT_VMF  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=301
321  TIMESTAP  RCLK_EDT  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=302; PARAM2=V_H
322  TIMEST_P  RCLK_EDT  CPU=QUICK; WAIT=321; PARALLEL=321
323  GPSXTR    RCLK_EDT  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=322
324  RCLK_CHK  RCLK_EDT  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=323; NEXTJOB=325 321
325  RESRMS    RCLK_EDT  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=324
331  MRKOBSAP  RCLK_EDT  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=325; PARAM2=BOTH
332  MRKOBS_P  RCLK_EDT  CPU=QUICK; WAIT=331; PARALLEL=331
351  CCRNXC    RCLK_EDT  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=325
352  OBSXTR    RCLK_EDT  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=325
361  GOTO      NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=332 351 352; NEXTJOB=
390  INIT_IAR  RCLK_IAR  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=361
#
# Combined Code and Phase solution
# --------------------------------
399  WAIT_BPE  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=390; PARAM1=500
400  RCLKWAIT  RCLK_GEN  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=399; PARAM1=RA_ORBIT; PARAM2=RA_ORBIT; PARAM3=14
401  INIT_HOI  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=400
402  INIT_VMF  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=401
410  SOSUPDAT  RCLK_GEN  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=402
411  GLOESTAP  RCLK_RES  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=410; PARAM2=V_U; PARAM3=PROTOCOL
412  GLOEST_P  RCLK_RES  CPU=LONG; WAIT=411; PARALLEL=411
413  GPSXTR    RCLK_RES  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=412
414  RESRMS    RCLK_RES  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=412
421  ADDNEQ2   RCLK_RE2  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=412 413
422  CRDMERGE  RCLK_RE2  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=421
423  TRPMERGE  RCLK_RE2  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=421; PARAM1=$O_$YSS+; PARAM2=$K_$YSS+; PARAM3=$U_$YSS+
424  CCRNXC    RCLK_RES  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=422
450  DO_PPPAR  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=414 423 424; NEXTJOB=411
#
# Verfy the clock solution, clock prediction
# ------------------------------------------
451  CODSPPCP  RCLK_PRD  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=450; PARAM2=TP_
452  CODSPP_P  RCLK_RES  CPU=QUICK; WAIT=451; PARALLEL=451
453  OBSXTR    RCLK_RES  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=450
471  CLK_PRED  RCLK_PRD  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=450
472  CLKP_CHK  RCLK_PRD  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=471; NEXTJOB=475
473  CODSPPCP  RCLK_PRD  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=472 452; PARAM2=TPP
474  CODSPP_P  RCLK_PRD  CPU=QUICK; WAIT=473; PARALLEL=473
475  DUMMY     NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=453 474
#
# High-rate clocks
# ----------------
# 499 WAIT_BPE NO_OPT            LOCAL    1 414 423 475
499  WAIT_BPE  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=475; PARAM1=900
500  MKCLUS    RCLK_HRC  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=499; PARAM1=V_U
501  CLKESTCB  RCLK_HRC  CPU=LONG; WAIT=500; PARAM1=V_Q
502  CCRNXC    RCLK_HR1  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=501
510  CCRNXC    RCLK_HRC  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=502
520  HCCRNXCB  RCLK_HR2  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=510; PARAM1=V_Q; PARAM2=V_U
521  HCCRNXCB  RCLK_HR3  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=520; PARAM1=V_Q; PARAM2=V_U
531  FILESTAP  RCLK_NLI  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=521
532  FILEST_P  RCLK_NLI  CPU=FOX; WAIT=531; PARALLEL=531
533  PHABIA    RCLK_NLI  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=532
534  IAR_VER   RCLK_NLI  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=533
590  DUMMY     NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=520
591  RAP_BIA   RCLK_BIA  CPU=BIG; WAIT=590
#
# Finish the story
# ----------------
899  WAIT_BPE  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=534 590; PARAM1=999
900  RCLK1PRC  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=899
#
# Regular processing
# ------------------
#
910  GOTO_REP  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=900; NEXTJOB=950
911  RCLK1SAV  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=910
912  RCLK1DEL  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=911
#
# FTPRAPID sequence
# -----------------
920  CRTRAP    IGSR_RAP  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=912; CAMPAIGN=IGSRAPID; PARAM1=V_U
#
931  IGSR_DI2  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=920; CAMPAIGN=IGSRAPID; CONT_ERR
932  IGSR_SA2  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=931; CAMPAIGN=IGSRAPID
933  IGSR_DIS  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=932; CAMPAIGN=IGSRAPID; CONT_ERR
#
940  CRTRAP3   IGSR_RT2  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=933; CAMPAIGN=IGSRAPID
#
# Reprocessing
# ------------------
950  GOTO_REP  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=932 940; NEXTJOB=_ 999
961  OBS_SAV   NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=950; SKIP
962  REPC_SAV  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=950
963  REPC_DEL  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=961 962
#
999  BPE_BYE   NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=963
#
# additional parameters required for PID's
#

VARIABLE     DEFAULT        PARAMETERS
V_DOI      = 10.48620/97772; DESCRIPTION=Product DOI
#
# Solution IDs used in the BPE:
# ----------------------------
V_A        = BRD;           DESCRIPTION=Broadcast clocks
V_K        = RA;            DESCRIPTION=Orbit and coordinates from IGSRAPID
V_W        = C0;            DESCRIPTION=CODSPP apriori solution
V_I        = CW;            DESCRIPTION=Weights for the code observations
V_B        = CR;            DESCRIPTION=Code screening
V_C        = CB;            DESCRIPTION=Unify inter-system/frequency biases
V_E        = CC;            DESCRIPTION=CLKEST for starting the MAUPRP
V_H        = T0;            DESCRIPTION=Code+phase screening in reg. clusters
V_U        = TP;            DESCRIPTION=Final results, code+phase (after edit)
V_O        = CE;            DESCRIPTION=Merged CRD+TRP files for CLKEST
V_Q        = HR;            DESCRIPTION=Final results CLKEST: high-rate clocks
#
# Reference frame and station related files:
# -----------------------------------------
V_CRDINF   = IGC20;         DESCRIPTION=CRD/VEL/FIX master file name
V_PSDINF   = IGC20;         DESCRIPTION=PSD corrections
#
V_STAINF   = CODE;          DESCRIPTION=Station information file
#
# General and model files:
# -----------------------
V_OBSSEL   = OBSERV_COD;    DESCRIPTION=Observation selection file
V_SATINF   = SATELLIT;      DESCRIPTION=Satellite information file
V_PCVINF   = ANT_COD;       DESCRIPTION=PCV information file
V_PCV      = I20;           DESCRIPTION=GNSS PCV model
V_ANTAZI   = YES;           DESCRIPTION=Consider antenna rotations (YES|NO)
V_PCC4MWGF = 2022 11 27;    DESCRIPTION=PCC applied for MW/GF LC
#
V_SYSCRX   = SAT_GNSS;      DESCRIPTION=Satellite problem file for data import
#
V_SUBMOD   = DESAI2016;     DESCRIPTION=Subdaily pole model
V_NUTMOD   = IAU2000R06;    DESCRIPTION=Nutation model
V_GRAVMOD = COSTG_FSM_2603; DESCRIPTION=Gravity field model
#
V_TRPMOD   = GPT3;          DESCRIPTION=Default troposphere model
#
V_BLQINF   = FES2014b;      DESCRIPTION=BLQ file name, CMC corrections
#
# Ambiguity resolution:
# --------------------
V_IAR      = Y;             DESCRIPTION=Perform ZERO_AR using DO_PPPAR
V_ARMODE   = RCLK;          DESCRIPTION=AR mode for DO_PPPAR; CARDS=FCLK MCLK RCLK
#
# Processing options used in the BPE:
# ----------------------------------
V_GNSS     = GRE;           DESCRIPTION=GNSS to be processed (GRESCJ)
#
V_BOXWNG   = BOXWING_I20;   DESCRIPTION=Boxwing model file
V_SP3INT   = 300;           DESCRIPTION=Sampling in archived precise files
V_SAMPL    = 300;           DESCRIPTION=Sampling rate of the GPSEST solution
#
V_NCLU     = 14;            DESCRIPTION=Number of clusters to be used
V_NSTA     = 35;            DESCRIPTION=Number of stations per cluster
#
V_REQ_CAMP = RCLKGNSS;      DESCRIPTION=Campaign to be used
V_RERUN    = 1;             DESCRIPTION=Number of reruns in case of failure
V_PLUS     = +0;            DESCRIPTION=Plus  days
V_MINUS    = -0;            DESCRIPTION=Minus days
#
V_BIAINF   = SINEX_BIA_COD; DESCRIPTION=BIAS SINEX information skeleton
#
# Other variables:
# ---------------
V_SAVDSK   = N;             DESCRIPTION=Start from savdsk, skip crtrap
V_INI      = Y;             DESCRIPTION=BPE initalization mode (Y/N/Verified)
V_MID      = Y;             DESCRIPTION=Use of middle day (if available)?
V_XTR      = Y;             DESCRIPTION=Automatic program extraction (GPSXTR)
V_UPD      = Y;             DESCRIPTION=Update general files?
V_SAV      = Y;             DESCRIPTION=Save results?
V_DEL      = Y;             DESCRIPTION=Delete results?
V_DIS      = Y;             DESCRIPTION=Distribute results?
